{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_grocery_redesign", "label": "Grocery Digital Shopping Notebook Redesign", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sequenced data model -> offline sync -> UI because that order minimizes rework; web must keep compiling (shared domain is consumed by web/src/modules/grocery) but gets no UI redesign."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_stores", "label": "stores Table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backfilled from distinct grocery_sessions.store_name; store_name text is kept on sessions during the transition while a nullable store_id FK is added, so no big-bang cutover is required."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_stores", "label": "product_stores Join Table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holds per-store price, aisle, availability and sku with a unique (product_id, store_id); this is what makes future price-comparison and auto aisle grouping possible without another migration."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_catalog", "label": "product_catalog (extended)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gains brand, barcode, package_size, image_path, notes and is_favorite while keeping existing default_quantity/default_unit/lifespan_days/purchase_count/last_purchased_at used by suggestions."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_lists_as_templates", "label": "Lists Become Pure Templates", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checking and purchasing move exclusively into errand sessions; is_checked/checked_by/checked_at fall out of use and the sync_grocery_item_on_session_purchase trigger is removed. Tables are kept rather than dropped so web and collaboration FKs do not break."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_errand_session", "label": "Errand Session (GrocerySession)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately no 'paused' status \u2014 'Resume Later' simply leaves the session active, keeping the state machine at active|completed plus cancel-by-delete. Gains name, store_id and updated_at (needed for sync LWW anyway)."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_price_feedback_policy", "label": "Price Feedback Policy on Session Complete", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On completion, catalog-linked items upsert their last price_paid and aisle back into product_stores. Temporary items with no product_id must never touch the catalog \u2014 an explicit spec requirement to keep one-off purchases out of the permanent catalog."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_offline_sync", "label": "Mobile-Only Offline Sync Architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core lives in shared domain/sync with a platform-agnostic storage interface (no RN or DOM imports) so it is shared-ready even though only mobile uses it today."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncqueue", "label": "SyncQueue Outbox", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordered outbox with enqueue/peek/markDone/markFailed and coalescing over PendingOp records carrying opId, type, entity, payload and baseUpdatedAt."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncengine", "label": "SyncEngine (push then pull)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drains the outbox through repositories, then pulls a delta by updated_at and reseeds the React Query cache. The pull after push is what reconciles DB-trigger side effects and other devices' writes. 4xx drops the op and surfaces it; network errors retain it."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_sqlitesyncstorage", "label": "SqliteSyncStorage (expo-sqlite)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mobile implementation of the SyncStorage interface providing the expo-sqlite outbox and cache."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_lww_conflict_resolution", "label": "Last-Write-Wins Conflict Resolution", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LWW keyed on updated_at chosen over CRDTs for simplicity; Phase A exists partly to add the missing updated_at columns and triggers this strategy depends on."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_client_generated_uuids", "label": "Client-Generated UUIDs on Create", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Create DTOs accept an optional id so offline-created rows already have their final identity; dependent offline operations then need no id remapping when the queue drains."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_auth_hardening", "label": "Offline Auth Hardening", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AppState drives startAutoRefresh/stopAutoRefresh, and AuthContext treats network errors during token refresh as 'offline but still authed' \u2014 signing out only on an invalid-refresh-token, so airplane mode never logs the user out."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_online_only_operations", "label": "Online-Only Operations Carve-Out", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Invitations, member management and the findUserByEmail RPC are disabled offline with a hint, because they depend on server-side identity resolution that cannot be queued meaningfully."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_notebook_ui", "label": "Paper Notebook UI Direction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Paper texture, ruled-line rows, handwritten display font, sticky-note notes, colored category chips, large touch targets and bottom-reachable actions for one-hand use; dark mode must preserve the notebook aesthetic."}, {"id": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_deferred_non_goals", "label": "Deferred Grocery Non-Goals", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Barcode hardware, voice input, spending analytics, import/export, price comparison and auto aisle grouping are explicitly out of scope now, but the schema (barcode, product_stores, history) is designed so they need no future migration."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_grocery_redesign", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_stores", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_stores", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_stores", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_stores", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_catalog", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_price_feedback_policy", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_product_stores", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_price_feedback_policy", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_errand_session", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_lists_as_templates", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_errand_session", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_errand_session", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_stores", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_offline_sync", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncqueue", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncengine", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncqueue", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_sqlitesyncstorage", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_offline_sync", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncengine", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_lww_conflict_resolution", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_lww_conflict_resolution", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_errand_session", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_client_generated_uuids", "target": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_syncqueue", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/grocery-redesign-plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_grocery_redesign_plan_auth_hardening", "target": "docs_grocer